{"v":1,"source":"Moonton (mobilelegends.com)","patch":"2.2.16","updated":"2026-10-08","hero":{"name":"Granger","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a7729262d5b4abdc34ae5181e964c235.png","head_big":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/5d272478f2f89dcae9e6896cb19743ac.jpg","square":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3342c4916fa8afc548bf6f5dc137ef26.jpg","squarebig":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_210fbb68eac6f90b1b14b05e8334cca8.jpg","smallmap":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9ed57f48f91012fd110935258cd1ab61.png","wallpaper":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f44e2457fb0f3539937c6a181e5dcbc4.png","hero_id":79,"wallpaper_source":"painting"},"stats":{"win":43.05,"pick":1.37,"ban":1.46},"compat":{"metric":"pp","best":[{"hero":"Baxia","value":9.8},{"hero":"Floryn","value":4.4},{"hero":"Popol and Kupa","value":3.8},{"hero":"Valentina","value":3.0},{"hero":"Fredrinn","value":2.3}],"worst":[{"hero":"Moskov","value":-8.0},{"hero":"Clint","value":-6.1},{"hero":"Claude","value":-6.0},{"hero":"Obsidia","value":-5.8},{"hero":"Beatrix","value":-5.0}]},"lore":{"short":"A mysterious demon hunter that operates outside the conventions of the Church of Light. Always seen with a violin case in hand, he hunts down demons with his two soul-devouring weapons.","long":null},"meta":{"difficulty":"30","speciality":["Burst","Finisher"],"roadsort":["Gold Lane"],"sort":["Marksman"],"recommend":"3-1-2","sorticon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_094c17e22ff5e8086641e9a2c67dd81e.png","roadicon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b4302450af5d1f55adf07399b4d3ed95.png"},"skills":[{"id":7940,"name":"Capriccio","description":"Granger's unique Demon Hunting Gun and Cannon are powered by Demonic Energy. Both his weapons start with 800 max Energy. His Gun restores 8% Energy per second while his Cannon restores 2% Energy per second. Killing a Minion / Creep permanently increases their max Energy by 6 / 6, and instantly restores their Energy by 5% / 5%, respectively. Each kill or assist on an enemy hero permanently increases both weapons' max Energy by 12 and instantly restores 10% Energy.\n\nEvery 1% Cooldown Reduction converts to 2 . Demonic Energy costs are not affected by Energy Cost Reduction.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bc047a2c81d46bab9fbb33613806eb2d.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":7910,"name":"Rhapsody","description":"Granger rapidly fires 6 shot(s) with his Gun, with each shot dealing 60 (+45% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and consuming 70 Gun Energy. The last shot is guaranteed to Crit. While firing, Granger's Movement Speed is increased by 10%.\n\nGranger stops firing when he runs out of Energy, or when the skill is cast again. Rhapsody has no cooldown and can be cast once his Gun Energy is over 420.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4d4dbe5a7f0b4f112e719be3024cf8b0.png","video":null,"cd":0.3,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":7920,"name":"Rondo","description":"Granger uses his Demon Hunter agility to dash in the target direction, instantly restoring 15% Energy for his Gun.\n\nRondo can be cast while channeling Rhapsody. Each time Rhapsody hits an enemy, Rondo's Cooldown is reduced by 0.5s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a33c876aa83af3bed09b1e6a8d16f638.png","video":null,"cd":12.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":7930,"name":"Death Sonata","description":"Granger fires his Cannon in the target direction, dealing 150 (+110% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the first enemy hero hit and other targets in the blast radius. Targets hit will be briefly slowed. Granger can roll in the Joystick's direction after each shot.\nDeath Sonata can be cast while firing Rhapsody. Death Sonata has a brief cooldown and consumes 250 of Granger's Cannon Energy per shot.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_228164a926a169586aec6f69aa68a128.png","video":null,"cd":0.6,"cost":250.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Granger pairs well with heroes that have strong CC abilities, such as Franco and Kaja, who can hold enemies in place for Granger's entire 1st Skill.","heroes":[{"id":10,"name":"Franco","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9bed3c0095335606e0ce616c6e5a8553.png"},{"id":62,"name":"Kaja","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d558bb881e18a070eaeda1e1fdc248a8.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Granger counters squishy heroes who lack mobility, such as Chang'e and Cecilion, who have a hard time dodging his 1st Skill and are vulnerable to the high damage of his Ultimate.","heroes":[{"id":61,"name":"Chang'e","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_46cfe9c30e8a14f85b4d022496aca274.png"},{"id":91,"name":"Cecilion","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_045399c265021d47da6512e6de20b64f.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Granger is countered by heroes with strong single target killing power. Despite having good mobility, Granger lacks other defensive measures. Heroes like Saber and Hayabusa can quickly get the jump on Granger and finish him off.","heroes":[{"id":3,"name":"Saber","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6bbfac806f29d29f17fea9e98d2d2fee.png"},{"id":21,"name":"Hayabusa","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9cc074562291a02644a0ddae28eeaa42.png"}]}},"skins":[{"name":"Doomsday Terminator","name_slug":"Doomsday-Terminator","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/granger/Granger-Doomsday-Terminator-20211010075422.webp","image_filename":"Granger-Doomsday-Terminator-20211010075422.webp","released":"2021-10-10","is_original":true},{"name":"Biosoldier","name_slug":"Biosoldier","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/granger/Granger-Biosoldier-20211010075513.webp","image_filename":"Granger-Biosoldier-20211010075513.webp","released":"2021-10-10","is_original":false},{"name":"Lightborn Overrider","name_slug":"Lightborn---Overrider","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/granger/Granger-Lightborn---Overrider-20211010075446.webp","image_filename":"Granger-Lightborn---Overrider-20211010075446.webp","released":"2021-10-10","is_original":false},{"name":"Starfall Knight","name_slug":"Starfall-Knight","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/granger/Granger-Starfall-Knight-20211010075548.webp","image_filename":"Granger-Starfall-Knight-20211010075548.webp","released":"2021-10-10","is_original":false},{"name":"Megatron","name_slug":"Megatron","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/granger/Granger-Megatron-20211010075603.webp","image_filename":"Granger-Megatron-20211010075603.webp","released":"2021-10-10","is_original":false},{"name":"Hellbringer","name_slug":"Hellbringer","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/granger/Granger-Hellbringer-20211221013521.webp","image_filename":"Granger-Hellbringer-20211221013521.webp","released":"2021-12-21","is_original":false},{"name":"Alluring Enigma","name_slug":"Alluring-Enigma","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub